 dy for cozy season with our next project: a Quilted book cover. Whether yo
 u're a beginner or experienced sewist\, this project is perfect practice f
 or basting\, quilting\, binding\, and much more! This book cover is design
 ed to be adjustable for most standard hardback US published fiction novels
 .\nThis program is only open to adults 18+.\nSpace is limited\, so please 
 register at smcl.org/events to reserve your spot. All sessions with the sa
 me title are identical\, so please only sign up for one to give others an 
