UID:smcl-6ad6499ede300e00451b6c91@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the custom screenprint workshop! You will learn how
  to screenprint an original design by Buppydogs/Alicia Cardell (They/Them)
 . Alicia is a Queer Nonbinary Taiwanese-American artist that makes illustr
 ations for mental health. BRING YOUR OWN FABRICS!! The design is approxima
 tely 3” by 3”\, and we will be using water based non-toxic fabric ink 
 so it’ll stay on permanently. The smoother the surface the better the pr
 int will come out. We will figure out where you'd like to place the custom
  print the day of.\n\nRegistration is required\, and space is limited. Reg
 istration opens on October 28 at 6:00 PM.\n\nAges: Adult program (kids wel
