SUMMARY:[ATH] Meet Carol Efron\, Author of A Hidden Fate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T183000
DTSTAMP:20261028T184231Z
UID:smcl-6ad646e6e06996003a848709@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join San Mateo County Libraries as we welcome Dr. Carol Efron 
 for a memorable discussion of her new book\, A Hidden Fate. The book explo
 res the question of whether we want to know our genetic destinies and how 
 these revelations change our expectations for ourselves and our life partn
 ers. Join Efron for a signing\, reading and discussion of the thoughtful a
 nd engaging novel which obtained a starred Kirkus review. \n\nEfron served
  on the full-time academic faculty at Johns Hopkins University\, then Stan
 ford\, before building a private practice of psychiatry in Menlo Park\, he
 r home base.\n\nRegistrations are encouraged but not required.\n\nAges: Ad
 ult program (kids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRegistrat
 ion: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6ad646e6e0699
 6003a848709\nLast synced: 2026-10-28 11:42 PDT
