UID:smcl-6ace9ec3ebad22004545217a@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Interested in picking up the fun life skill of sewing? Not sur
 e how to get started? Our Drop-in Sewing Machine Basics session will be pe
 rfect for you! You’ll be guided through all the basics of using a Baby L
 ock Jubilant machine. From winding a bobbin and threading the machine to r
 unning some simple stitches. We’ll help you learn some best practices an
 d gain skills that you can use on future projects. No registration is requ
 ired\, but sewing machines and space are limited. \n\nDrop-In Sewing Mach
 ine Basics is for adults 18 and older only. \n\nIf you are 6 to 18 years 
 old\, you are welcome to register for Jr. Sewing\, which occurs every thir
 d Tuesday of the month.\n\nAges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along
